# Fortune, Loyal Steed's end-of-combat trigger offers only "a creature that saddled it this turn" that is still on the battlefield
# (CR 400.7): after Bot2 Lightning Bolts the saddling Savannah Lions in response, the Lions are dead and not a choice, so Bot1 can
# pick only the Thraben Inspector, which comes back untapped and makes a second Clue as Fortune returns and scries again.

